[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_9998","text":"羽那的朋友"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0010","text":"——制作人？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0020","text":"嗯，马上就到演播室了\n……呵呵，没有迷路啦，没事──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0030","text":"──嗯，谢谢\n那待会儿见"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0040","text":"『同学会时的照片！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0050","text":"『大家都变成大人了吧？？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0060","text":"……真的诶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0070","text":"──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0080","text":"……是CoMETIK啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0090","text":"好厉害……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0100","text":"────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0110","text":"因为我觉得《送别的花束》\n是一首关于离别的歌……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0120","text":"因为很多事情都在不断变化……\n我觉得每一次变化，我们都在经历离别。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0130","text":"不只是环境和人与人之间的联系，\n还有改变之前的自己，以及所有一切的告别……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0140","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0150","text":"……要分开了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_9999","text":"小妹妹"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0160","text":"────那个！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0170","text":"……啊，是──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0180","text":"你是CoMETIK的铃木羽那酱……对吧！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0190","text":"……啊哈"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_99_0200","text":"──我是CoMETIK的铃木羽那！"}]
